  "description": "Childhood friends Ahn Do-Hun and Woo Ik-Su have been inseparable since elementary school, bonded by their shared love for the mid-tier baseball team, the Dolphins. But when Ik-Su decides to go to the team’s home opener with someone other than Do-Hun, the foundations of their friendship begin to crack. With this curveball, their relationship takes an unexpected turn…and as the Dolphins edge closer to a championship, Do-Hun and Ik-Su can’t seem to get one another off their minds. Will their relationship be able to make a comeback in the final inning? Or did Ik-Su’s foul play ruin his chance at scoring with Do-Hun forever…?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes eight side story chapters.*",
